Third-party files

These files are not covered by the terms above:

* vsc/src/: the source of GitHub's VS Code theme (https://github.com/primer/github-vscode-theme),
  with a patch that adds the two tritanopia variants, and vsc/vscode.json, built from it and from
  GitHub Primer (https://github.com/primer/primitives).
  Copyright (c) GitHub, Inc. MIT License: see LICENSE-github-vscode-theme.txt.

* jetbrains/*.theme.json: JetBrains' parent themes (Darcula, IntelliJ Light, expUI, Islands),
  copied unchanged from the JetBrains IDE; their source is in IntelliJ Platform
  (https://github.com/JetBrains/intellij-community, platform/platform-resources/src/themes/).
  Apache License 2.0: see LICENSE-jetbrains-apache-2.0.txt. IntelliJ Platform's NOTICE:

    This software includes code from IntelliJ IDEA
    Copyright (C) JetBrains s.r.o.
    https://www.jetbrains.com/idea/

* jetbrains/code_defaults.json, parity/inventory.json and parity/keyscan.json: colour key names and
  default colour values read from the installed JetBrains IDEs, recorded so the generated themes can
  override them.
